        "created_at": "2016-09-01T17:31:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello,</p><p>Now that it is getting into September, which is the estimated ship date, I was wondering if there is an update for the Meta Games II kickstarter. (www.kickstarter.com/projects/dicehateme/meta-games-ii-joke-games-that-are-serious-fun)</p><p>The last update was July 5th and I am starting to worry about this project. If there is any information on this project it would be appreciated.</p><p>Thanks,<br>~Alex</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
